  "failure_explanations": {
    "check.log": "Initial module visibility errors; internal codec helpers now crate-visible, no public external expansion.",
    "tests1.log": "Test fixture attempted private BusinessRepository.handle; now uses the actual StorageWriter handle.",
    "tests3.log,tests4.log": "Test fixture called nonexistent MaterialRepository::append; corrected append_material.",
    "tests5.log": "Synthetic admin fixture had no teaching assignment, so material scope correctly rejected; fixture now explicitly teaches class/subject.",
    "tests6.log,media-debug1.log,media-debug2.log,media-debug3.log": "Actual restore defect: changing profile content published revision without rebasing immutable current/previous violated domain history. Preserve exact published historical pair; advance independent view/layout/security generations and retired command ledger. Regression now proves current+previous and later publish.",
    "tests7.log": "Missing injected Clock in material-list fixture, corrected.",
    "tests9.log,clippy2.log": "Voice test used root namespace rather than fc_ports::voice, corrected.",
    "tests10.log": "Test helper Arc closure needed explicit ExecutionFence coercion, corrected.",
    "check7.log": "Intermediate preflight refactor placed barrier field reads outside proof branch, corrected."
  },
  "boundaries": [
    "Storage APIs assume trusted protected staging paths, caller-held file pins and physical worker/media quiescence; they do not perform live cold switching.",
    "Ordinary SQLite files are fresh whitelist projections with no copied credential pages; current protected snapshots only build isolated candidates.",
    "Only an identical nonzero 32-byte installation binding can restore automatically; cross-installation identity mapping is unsupported and rejected.",
    "Current credentials, login penalties, disabled roles/assignments, current OS operation journal survive; labels and defaults restore only against existing current identity.",
    "Published component revision and immutable previous/current pair preserve source historical meaning; safety epochs, layout/view generations, ID allocators and operation tombstones move forward.",
    "Calendar automatic policy grant is removed, pending operations never replay, voice assets/active queue/leases are removed; exact old system grants are not restored.",
    "16GiB database and combined 2GiB media allowances are independent recovery limits. SQLite per-value/SQL limits and progress checks are not a hard cap on every SQLite allocation or wall-clock preemption.",
    "Unit media and voice preparation is synthetic metadata, not proof of WIC, filesystem, native audio, Windows7/10/11 behavior."
  ],
